WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.630
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:10.010
Today I am going to explain the 2014 Sci-Fi
short film called “The Real Evidence: Laptop.”

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.630
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:18.310
Watch out and take care!

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:23.220
The movie begins with a montage of an office
where many employees are busy in their respective

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:24.240
works.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:28.369
Some are writing scraps on paper while others
are working on their laptops.

00:00:28.369 --> 00:00:33.060
One guy with glasses is also working on his
laptop when his eyes suddenly see something

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:34.470
on the wall near him.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:39.670
He finds it very unusual, and keeps on looking
at his laptop and the wall, in back and forth

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:40.670
motion.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:46.280
Astonishingly, the cursor of the laptop mouse
is seen hovering on the wall, out of his laptop

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.280
screen.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:51.670
The guy does not believe his eyes and when
he moves his fingers over the laptop touchpad,

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.030
the cursor on the wall moves.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:59.480
Seeing this, he becomes excited as he has
a smirk on his face.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:05.710
Then, he looks around to check if any of his
colleagues are seeing it.

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:11.150
The guy thinks of an idea to test if the mouse
cursor has real impacts on the physical environment.

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:15.360
He drags the cursor down from the wall by
controlling the movement through the touchpad.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.940
He then points to the paper cup on his table
and taps the button in the touchpad.

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:24.390
As he does this, the paper cup falls, and
the tea spills all over the table.

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:26.860
It catches the attention of his colleagues.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:31.080
As they look at him, he apologizes and acts
like he is cleaning the table.

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.620
After this successful trial with the paper
cup, he becomes happy.

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:39.300
The guy then looks around and finds another
thing to experiment with the cursor.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:43.070
He notices a letter on his table and drags
the arrow towards it.

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:47.790
As he hovers it around the letter—the pointer
changes to I-cursor as it comes to text.

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:52.030
The letter is about the request to deduct
the penalty for being late to work.

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:57.110
The guy clicks the cursor to it, deletes the
sentences, writes his boss is a jerk and asks

00:01:57.110 --> 00:02:00.910
to add compensation to his monthly fee.

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:04.670
After doing this, he takes the letter in his
hand and starts laughing at it.

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:08.700
As his laugh becomes audible, he finds it
disturbing to the colleagues and stops at

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:14.530
once awkwardly.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.830
He then looks over the letter and smiles.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:21.280
Following his experiments in the room, the
guy heads out, along with the mysterious laptop

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.310
in his hand.

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:26.420
As he strides into the hallway, he sees a
beautiful girl working in the next room.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.920
He sits on the chair in front of her room
from where he can see her.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:33.890
He then pretends to work on the laptop but
starts peeping at her secretly.

00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:38.280
The guy slowly takes the cursor out from the
laptop, down the table towards the room.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:42.650
While he drags it up her table, she turns
forward to see her papers and the guy gets

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:44.140
his eyes on her skirt.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:48.940
The devious guy then directs the mouse cursor
inside her dress and clicks the pad.

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:51.620
As he does so, the woman gasps in surprise.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:54.680
She feels something down below and breathes
slowly.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:58.190
The guy starts rubbing the mouse pad and peeps
to see her reaction.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:01.870
The girl begins breathing heavily and loses
control of her body.

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:06.410
She starts moaning after feeling highly erotic
as the guy speeds his rubbing action on the

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.410
mouse pad.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:10.900
She soon rushes to the bathroom while the
guy smiles.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:14.739
What a simp!

00:03:14.739 --> 00:03:18.750
After his shenanigans inside the office, the
guy heads out to his friend, who is talking

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.750
to two women.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:23.680
He asks his friend to come to him because
he has an emergency secret to share.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:28.180
They go to a rooftop and the guy demonstrates
what he has discovered by editing the board

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:36.180
written as 'Northern Credit Bank' into 'Noobs,
Clowns, and Bastards.'

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:41.840
The friend gets freaked out and asks him to
do something to a nearby parked car.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:46.290
The guy opens the program and starts reducing
the size of the car until it shrinks into

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.290
a toy.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:51.370
The friend gets super excited and tells him
that he cannot believe what he has found.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:58.459
He adds that it gives them unlimited opportunities,
and they can do anything with it.

00:03:58.459 --> 00:04:03.129
As his friend continues blabbering, the guy
copies a wall of a house and pastes it upon

00:04:03.129 --> 00:04:05.650
a window to close it with the wall.

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:09.519
Seeing this, the friend explains that if they
can open any program and make it work like

00:04:09.519 --> 00:04:12.519
that in the real world, they can do everything.

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:15.040
He exclaims it to be a teleportation device.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:18.989
At this point, the guy has started looking
at his friend with uneasy looks.

00:04:18.989 --> 00:04:22.979
The friend shares that they can go to a bank
and blackmail the manager into giving them

00:04:22.979 --> 00:04:25.669
money, with the threat of destroying the building.

00:04:25.669 --> 00:04:29.360
He further adds that after getting the money,
they will destroy the building anyways so

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.520
that the manager cannot tell anyone.

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:35.490
After hearing him, the guy has a weird look
on his face which implies that he doesn’t

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:39.749
like his friend’s idea.

00:04:39.749 --> 00:04:43.620
Down in the ground, the car’s owner returns
and doesn't find his car.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:48.349
However, when he looks down, he is shocked
to see a small toy similar to his car in the

00:04:48.349 --> 00:04:49.770
spot where he parked.

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:54.569
Meanwhile, the friend gets further ambitious
that they can do anything and no one can stop

00:04:54.569 --> 00:04:55.569
them.

00:04:55.569 --> 00:04:59.360
He shares that they can reach anyone, and
all the criminals, politicians and policemen

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.330
will obey their orders.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:04.740
The guy now starts getting frightened and
looks over the laptop.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:09.110
He clicks on the select icon and moves the
mouse cursor to frame the friend's body.

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:13.210
The friend is unknown and keeps saying that
if anyone comes to attack them, they will

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:15.360
ERASE them and solve the problem.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:19.639
The deranged friend even talks about removing
the army by pressing ‘delete’.

00:05:19.639 --> 00:05:24.190
The guy gets taken aback while his friend
sounds like a bomb while demonstrating about

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:25.759
wiping the army.

00:05:25.759 --> 00:05:30.939
As the friend faces the guy and raises his
hand to talk, He presses Control + X keys

00:05:30.939 --> 00:05:34.499
on the keyboard, which commands to cut the
selected object.

00:05:34.499 --> 00:05:38.569
As he does so, the friend's hand gets out
of the selection area of the cursor, and it

00:05:38.569 --> 00:05:41.460
detaches from the body while the body vanishes.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:45.819
The guy gets horrified and sees the event
without his eyes blinking, and hands held

00:05:45.819 --> 00:05:46.819
high.

00:05:46.819 --> 00:05:50.879
The severed hand falls on top of a car in
the ground with blood spilling out of it.

00:05:50.879 --> 00:05:55.669
As the hand thuds and the car starts beeping,
the guy snaps out of the horror.

00:05:55.669 --> 00:05:59.979
People immediately gather around the vehicle
and start panicking upon seeing the hand and

00:05:59.979 --> 00:06:00.979
blood.

00:06:00.979 --> 00:06:05.069
They yell to call the police and the ambulance
as the guy looks down the roof.

00:06:05.069 --> 00:06:08.949
Suddenly, the crowd looks at him and tells
him that he is in trouble for what he has

00:06:08.949 --> 00:06:09.949
done.

00:06:09.949 --> 00:06:11.729
They start calling him crazy and threaten
to call the police.

00:06:11.729 --> 00:06:12.729
They also repeatedly ask him to get down from
the roof.

00:06:12.729 --> 00:06:15.589
Upon hearing people screaming at him, the
guy starts panicking.

00:06:15.589 --> 00:06:17.960
He holds his laptop and opens a program.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:22.279
The guy then looks down to the ground and
selects the entire area, including the gathered

00:06:22.279 --> 00:06:23.879
people and the car.

00:06:23.879 --> 00:06:28.909
As the crowd shouts at him, he presses the
Cut command, and the mass, car, hand, and

00:06:28.909 --> 00:06:33.159
blood disappear instantly.

00:06:33.159 --> 00:06:36.719
The guy looks for them on all sides and gets
surprised himself.

00:06:36.719 --> 00:06:41.430
As he becomes breathless, he folds his laptop
and realizes what he has done.

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:45.509
After wreaking havoc in his workplace, the
guy hits the road and starts moving ahead.

00:06:45.509 --> 00:06:48.999
He has his bag to his side, and the laptop
held to his hand.

00:06:48.999 --> 00:06:52.710
As he walks, he looks in a hurry and continues
seeing back and forth.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:55.629
Soon, a car comes from the opposite direction.

00:06:55.629 --> 00:06:58.689
The guy shows his hand and asks to stop the
vehicle.

00:06:58.689 --> 00:07:02.020
He tells the driver that he wants to go to
the Kremlin with urgency.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:05.749
The driver denies him and tells him that the
traffic is awful there and they will get stuck

00:07:05.749 --> 00:07:06.960
for a long time.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:11.569
The guy pleads that he will provide the driver
with any money he demands, but he drives away

00:07:11.569 --> 00:07:12.860
with an apology.

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:16.210
As the driver moves ahead, the guy tries opening
his laptop.

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:19.339
He soon closes it as the vehicle goes out
of his sight.

00:07:19.339 --> 00:07:23.629
In the final scene, the guy keeps walking
forward and approaches a large building.

00:07:23.629 --> 00:07:27.569
As he looks here and there, he discovers a
large mouse arrow hovering in the building

00:07:27.569 --> 00:07:28.569
wall.

00:07:28.569 --> 00:07:31.659
He gets frightened and looks on all sides
to find nothing.

00:07:31.659 --> 00:07:36.419
As he tries to move ahead, he sees the cursor
arrow on the road, pointing towards him.

00:07:36.419 --> 00:07:38.499
The guy starts panting and gets worried.

00:07:38.499 --> 00:07:43.719
As he slowly takes some step back, the cursor
moves towards him and covers him totally.

00:07:43.719 --> 00:07:48.580
As he looks towards the sky, the cursor clicks
and he is squashed on the ground, and blood

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:49.580
is splattered all over.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:50.580
This suggests that someone else possesses
the magical power too.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:54.410
After finishing him off, the cursor starts
moving and goes out of frame.

